      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/gmanews/status/2008214436012757313",
      "text": "The Land Transportation Office (LTO) has begun issuing traffic violation tickets to e-bike and e-trike drivers traveling along certain national roads in Metro Manila whose number will grow this week.\n\nThis came after the LTO announced that it will enforce the ban on e-trikes and e-bikes on major thoroughfares in Metro Manila in 2026.\n\nRead more:\nhttps://t.co/ZHwKDUhifg",
