      "text": "[5:44PM] #Shomolu #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic movement from Adekunle intersection linking the 3rd Mainland bridge inward and outward is free at present. \nMakoko and Panti junction are in order and without delays.\nMovement onward journey Alagomeji is good to go. \n\nMovement aproaching Sabo is steady, due to the traffic alternation. \nSt Agnes inward Unilag junction,  YabaTech, WAEC down to Jibowu is moving steadily. \n\nMovement underneath the Jibowu bridge is free at the moment. \nJibowu inward Yaba phase 1and2 have smooth vehicular flow.\nThe strectch of Muritala Muhammad way down to Oyingbo is good to go. \n\nOyingbo inwand Iddo through Otto is good, likewise the return journey. \nOyingbo inwand Ile-lle is slightly busy due to market activities. \nKano st inward Apena Cemetary down to Adekunle is moving steadily. \n\nThere are no impediments in these areas, and our officers are present at various important locations, doing the needful.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
